The RESALE Act has passed first vote *unanimously* with:

1) a 10% cap restored on how much a ticket can be marked up when being resold;
2) a ban on reselling tickets you don’t possess:
3) list the original cost of the ticket;
4) requires all-in pricing upfront on all sales.
